    "title": "Jeff Sims puts forth career effort vs. Duke but ends Sun Bowl with backbreaking interception - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By DAMON ALLRED ,\n5 hours ago It was a Sun Bowl to remember for Arizona State and quarterback Jeff Sims despite their 42-39 loss to ACC champion Duke on Wednesday. In what was a career-best performance, Sims gave ASU its first lead of the day with a touchdown pass early in the fourth quarter, about seven minutes after a touchdown pass pulled the Sun Devils within three. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
